@startuml two_sided_operations
!theme plain
title URMA 双边操作 (Two-sided Operations - Send/Recv)

box "Host A (Sender)" #DDFFDD
    participant "Application" as App_A
    participant "Jetty A\n(JFS+JFR)" as Jetty_A
    participant "JFC A" as JFC_A
end box

participant "Network\n(UDMA)" as Network

box "Host B (Receiver)" #FFDDDD
    participant "Jetty B\n(JFS+JFR)" as Jetty_B
    participant "JFC B" as JFC_B
    participant "Application" as App_B
end box

note over App_A, App_B
    双边操作需要双方配合：
    1. 接收方先 post_recv() 预留 buffer
    2. 发送方 post_send() 发送数据
end note

== 准备阶段：接收方预留 buffer ==
App_B -> Jetty_B : urma_post_recv()\n(buffer 预留给即将到来的消息)
activate Jetty_B
Jetty_B -> JFC_B : Register pending WR
deactivate Jetty_B

note right of App_B
    接收方必须先 post_recv()
    否则发送方会收到 RNR 错误
    (Receiver Not Ready)
end note

== Send 操作 ==
App_A -> Jetty_A : urma_post_send()\n(data, target_jetty)
activate Jetty_A
Jetty_A -> Network : Send Request\n(with data and target JFR ID)
Network -> Jetty_B : Deliver to JFR\n(匹配 pending recv WR)
Jetty_B -> JFC_B : Generate CQE\n(通知接收方)
Jetty_B --> Network : ACK
Network --> Jetty_A : Completion
Jetty_A -> JFC_A : Generate CQE\n(通知发送方)
Jetty_A --> App_A : CQE
deactivate Jetty_A

== 接收方处理数据 ==
JFC_B --> App_B : urma_poll_jfc()\n(CQE 包含数据信息)
App_B -> App_B : 处理接收到的数据

note right of App_B
    CQE 包含：
    - 数据长度
    - 发送方信息
    - 立即数 (如果有)
end note

@enduml
